'' type<T>( args ) OVER A TYPE WITH CONSTRUCTORS is one constructor call, also where its address
'' is taken (a byref argument, a WITH subject). tiko default-constructed it first: two
'' constructors, one destructor. Expected output is fbc-modern's (fbc's compound/with.bas).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/udt-typelit-ctor.bas -o tests/codegen/udttypelitctor.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/udttypelitctor.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: A:[c 5] takeR 5[d]  1 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: B:[c 6] 6[d]  1 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: C:[c 7] takeR 7[d]  1 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: D:[c 8] 8[d]  1 1
